            "id": "20260927A000OB00",
            "title": "中、美双线夹击，宁德系再诉海辰储能",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OsxYCDbuCGJOmEEFd5OCk2cU-AbsVbUl7usxUE1UWmGkgAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260927A000OB00",
            "author": "连续阅读7天",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-27 00:04:11",
            "description": "<div id=\"article-content\"><div class=\"article-top-content\"><div class=\"ac-ask-ai\" style=\"--ac-ask-yuanbao-icon-default:url('https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0318120013369_320/0')\"><div class=\"ac-ask-ai-left\"><span class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-icon\"></span><div class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-content\"><span class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-content-ask\">问AI</span><span> · </span><span class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-content-text\">新能达携宁德系专利墙出击，海辰海外蛋糕如何守？</span></div></div><svg class=\"ruyi-icon ruyi-icon-chevron-right-regular\" height=\"24\" id=\"chevron-right-regular\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M9 5L16 12L9 19\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></g></svg></div></div><div class=\"comps-contentify-wrap comps-contentify-pc-wrap\"><div class=\"qnt-p\"><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">海辰储能</span></span></span>刚在美国被起诉了，这次是宁德系合资公司<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">新能达</span></span></span>出手，告它侵犯六件美国专利。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">这六件专利全来自<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">宁德新能源ATL</span></span></span>。里头有两件还是当年ATL告<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">珠海冠宇</span></span></span>的王牌，在美国和国内都没被无效掉。海辰这下麻烦大了。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">其实宁德系早就布好局了。国内那边，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">宁德时代</span></span></span>告了海辰不正当竞争、抢专利，海辰的上市进度直接被拖慢，两次<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">港股递表</span></span></span>都失效了。此外，海辰的<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">41专利</span></span></span>还遭遇集中无效挑战。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">到了美国战场，新能达这个原告更值得琢磨。这家公司ATL占大头，等于海辰直接撞上了ATL的专利墙。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">更要命的是市场数据。2026 年上半年，海辰储能在储能电池出货量上被<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">亿纬锂能</span></span></span>反超，退居全球第三。之前高达200%的增幅也明显放缓了。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">美国本来占了海辰四分之一的海外市场。现在专利诉讼加上政治标签双重夹击，这块大蛋糕怕是不好啃了。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O4ItBu6gDtScG-fwAW4nPRCSt1Fv4FiRLQL8pxB346WzwAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O4ItBu6gDtScG-fwAW4nPRCSt1Fv4FiRLQL8pxB346WzwAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Ow7m0tOU4Gs5PsmdAGzAgu2rg9jQiBe-Z3562fRKOY5mAAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Ow7m0tOU4Gs5PsmdAGzAgu2rg9jQiBe-Z3562fRKOY5mAAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OzIrg2sz8ilsTzIBjApB783NFGocAn9fC6m3lmisMhzSsAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OzIrg2sz8ilsTzIBjApB783NFGocAn9fC6m3lmisMhzSsAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div></div></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
